        "created_at": "2019-10-30T17:28:14.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>That said, when Craig created Dynamo, Christopher seemed surprised that the character creation rules let you do that and suggested he'd allow it for Dynamo but was going to take a closer look at it.&nbsp; The rules we got still don't forbid it but maybe it'll be&nbsp;mentioned somewhere else in the final book.&nbsp; Or maybe they decided it was fine after all.</p>",
